As I've learned here on RGRN and have come to agree with: the main
reason (for me) for grey dragon scale mail is that as an early wish
for a suit of +2 GDSM satisfies two very important life savers ~
fabulous AC and magic resistance, and lets you cast spells.  Sure
reflection is nice but MR is more important and having it early saves
lives.  A golden naga or ill-tempered lich can no longer vaporize your
armor, etc.  However, if I already had a source of MR (such as the
Eye) then I would next want Silver DSM.  Yellow is fashionable, sure,
but how often is acid a concern?  In the absence of Silver or Grey
mail I would go for yellow, sure, but possibly orange because very few
at the Demigod bar are wearing orange.

oh yeah, some classes can have their Magic Resistance artifact stolen
by the Wizard!

